stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> Idle
 Idle --> Browsing: Start
 Browsing --> Selecting: Catalog loaded
 Browsing --> Unavailable: Catalog error
 Unavailable --> Idle: Acknowledge
 Selecting --> AwaitingPayment: Confirm order
 AwaitingPayment --> Authorizing: Card selected
 AwaitingPayment --> PaymentPending: QR created
 Authorizing --> Paid: Verified approval
 Authorizing --> Declined: Rejected
 Authorizing --> ReconciliationRequired: Timeout / unknown
 PaymentPending --> Paid: Verified callback/query success
 PaymentPending --> Declined: Failure callback
 PaymentPending --> Expired: Expiry confirmed
 PaymentPending --> ReconciliationRequired: No definitive result
 Selecting --> Cancelled: Cancel
 AwaitingPayment --> Cancelled: Cancel before payment
 Paid --> IssuingTicket: Create ticket once
 IssuingTicket --> Completed: Print successful
 IssuingTicket --> PrinterFault: Print failed
 PrinterFault --> Completed: Retry / recovery recorded
 ReconciliationRequired --> Paid: Gateway confirms success
 ReconciliationRequired --> Declined: Gateway confirms failure
 Completed --> Idle: Reset
 Declined --> Idle: Reset
 Expired --> Idle: Reset
 Cancelled --> Idle: Reset